Package: waydesk-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: José Mendonça <jmendonca@gmail.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: waydesk-server (>= @VERSION@), foot, qt6-wayland, qt6ct, pcmanfm-qt, qterminal, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, gnome-software, gnome-software-plugin-flatpak, gvfs, gvfs-daemons, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-noto, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, dbus-user-session, dbus-bin, xdg-utils, python3, papirus-icon-theme, librsvg2-common, libglib2.0-bin, dconf-gsettings-backend, gtk-update-icon-cache, pkexec, wmenu, whiptail, waydesk-shell
Recommends: chromium (>= 100)
Description: Windows-like desktop for waydesk sessions
 Default sway configuration for the sessions of waydesk (floating windows,
 Alt+Tab, a launcher, screenshots), the shell (DankMaterialShell, built by
 Waydesk as the package waydesk-shell) that it starts, and waydesk-setup,
 a wizard that installs browsers, office, developer and creative apps.
